Test:
- Unauthenticated API access.
- Cross-patient access attempts.
- Cross-clinic access attempts.
- Privilege escalation.
- Invalid input.
- Duplicate bookings.
- Repeated submissions.
- File upload restrictions.
- Session expiry.
